\“They've got the niece's name on them.” #id:line.Day1.reading.052
\“The aunt has taken the ribbon off.” #id:line.Day1.reading.053
\“He could say he wanted to see her.” #id:line.Day1.reading.054
\Sylvia offers the book across the saucers. #id:line.Day1.reading.055
\“Then say it.” #id:line.Day1.reading.056
\“I wanted to see you.” #id:line.Day1.reading.057
\She looks down at the page; her finger stays still for half a beat. #id:line.Day1.reading.058
\“Much shorter.” #id:line.Day1.reading.059
\“They could have saved paper.” #id:line.Day1.reading.060
